  OpenCC dictionaries (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC),
  exported through opencc-js 1.4.2. See scripts/gen-chinese-variant-table.mjs
  and the header comment of that file for the exact source dictionaries.
- Icon glyph data comes from the lucide icon set distributed as
